e this module.\", \"name\": \"qualifying_relative\", \"roles\": [\"claimant\", \"subject\", \"year\"]}, {\"functional\": false, \"meaning\": \"The subject is a dependent of the claimant for the year under section 152(a).\", \"name\": \"dependent\", \"roles\": [\"claimant\", \"subject\", \"year\"]}, {\"functional\": false, \"meaning\": \"A deduction under section 151 is allowable to the claimant with respect to the subject for the year.\", \"name\": \"deduction_under_section_151_allowable\", \"roles\": [\"claimant\", \"subject\", \"year\"]}], \"output_predicates\": [{\"functional\": false, \"meaning\": \"Neutral enumeration of only the persons and taxable years actually named in the case or query.\", \"name\": \"case_subject_year\", \"roles\": [\"person\", \"year\"]}, {\"functional\": false, \"meaning\": \"The subject is a qualifying child of the claimant for the year; its section 152(c) tests are outside this module.\", \"name\": \"qualifying_child\", \"roles\": [\"claimant\", \"subject\", \"year\"]}, {\"functional\": false, \"meaning\": \"The subject is a qualifying relative of the claimant for the year; its section 152(d) tests are outside this module.\", \"name\": \"qualifying_relative\", \"roles\": [\"claimant\", \"subject\", \"year\"]}, {\"functional\": false, \"meaning\": \"The subject is a dependent of the claimant for the year under section 152(a).\", \"name\": \"dependent\", \"roles\": [\"claimant\", \"subject\", \"year\"]}, {\"functional\": false, \"meaning\": \"Section 152(a)'s dependent definition applies to the claimant, subject, and year.\", \"name\": \"section_152_a_applies\", \"roles\": [\"claimant\", \"subject\", \"year\"]}, {\"functional\": false, \"meaning\": \"Section 152(b)(1) applies because the subject is a dependent of the claimant for a taxable year beginning in the calendar year.\", \"name\": \"section_152_b_1_applies\", \"roles\": [\"claimant\", \"subject\", \"year\"]}, {\"functional\": false, \"meaning\": \"Section 151(c) applies to the claimant's dependent subject for the year.\", \"name\": \"section_151_c_applies\", \"roles\": [\"claimant\", \"subject\", \"year\"]}, {\"functional\": false, \"meaning\": \"A deduction under section 151 is allowable to the claimant with respect to the subject for the year.\", \"name\": \"deduction_under_section_151_allowable\", \"roles\": [\"claimant\", \"subject\", \"year\"]}, {\"functional\": false, \"meaning\": \"The general exemption-amount rule of section 151(d)(1) applies to the subject and year, subject to subsection overrides.\", \"name\": \"section_151_d_1_applies\", \"roles\": [\"subject\", \"year\"]}, {\"functional\": false, \"meaning\": \"Section 151(d)(2) applies because a section 151 deduction for the subject is allowable to a distinct other taxpayer for the relevant year.\", \"name\": \"section_151_d_2_applies\", \"roles\": [\"other_taxpayer\", \"subject\", \"year\"]}, {\"functional\": false, \"meaning\": \"The subject's taxable year begins after December 31, 2017, and before January 1, 2026.\", \"name\": \"taxable_year_begins_in_151_d_5_period\", \"roles\": [\"subject\", \"year\"]}, {\"functional\": false, \"meaning\": \"Section 151(d)(5) applies to the subject's taxable year.\", \"name\": \"section_151_d_5_applies\", \"roles\": [\"subject\", \"year\"]}, {\"functional\": true, \"meaning\": \"The final exemption amount applicable to the subject for the year.\", \"name\": \"exemption_amount\", \"roles\": [\"subject\", \"year\", \"amount\"]}, {\"functional\": false, \"meaning\": \"Applicability of the new source clause with the exact same normalized antecedent; role meanings retained from151(d)(2).\", \"name\": \"section_63_c_5_applies\", \"roles\": [\"other_taxpayer\", \"subject\", \"year\"]}], \"output_literals\": [\"zero\", \"$2,000\"], \"cases\": [{\"ordinal\": 81, \"facts\": \"Alice and Charlie have been married since 2 Feb 2015. Bob counts as Alice's dependent under section 152(c)(1) for 2015.\", \"query\": \"Alice can claim an exemption with Bob the dependent for 2015 under section 151(c).\"}, {\"ordinal\": 86, \"facts\": \"Alice has a son, Bob, who satisfies section 152(c)(1) for the year 2015. Bob has a son, Charlie, who satisfies section 152(c)(1) for the year 2015.\", \"query\": \"Section 152(b)(1) applies to Bob for the year 2015.\"}, {\"ordinal\": 72, \"facts\": \"Alice is entitled to an exemption under section 151(d) for Bob for the year 2015.\", \"query\": \"Under section 151(d)(2), Bob's exemption amount for the year 2015 is equal to $2000.\"}, {\"ordinal\": 87, \"facts\": \"In 2017, Alice was paid $33200. Alice and Bob have been married since Feb 3rd, 2017. Bob earned $10 in 2017. Alice and Bob file separate returns. Alice is not entitled to a deduction for Bob under section 151.\", \"query\": \"Section 63(c)(5) applies to Bob's basic standard deduction in 2017.\"}]}","role":"user"}],"model":"Qwen/Qwen3-8B","response_format":{"json_schema":{"name":"rr_joint_proposal","schema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"cases":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"facts":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"atom":{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"arguments":{"items":false,"maxItems":2,"minItems":2,"prefixItems":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"string"}],"type":"array"},"positive":{"type":"boolean"},"predicate":{"enum":["case_subject_year"]}},"required":["predicate","arguments","positive"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"arguments":{"items":false,"maxItems":3,"minItems":3,"prefixItems":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"string"},{"type":"string"}],"type":"array"},"positive":{"type":"boolean"},"predicate":{"enum":["qualifying_child"]}},"required":["predicate","arguments","positive"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"arguments":{"items":false,"maxItems":3,"minItems":3,"prefixItems":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"string"},{"type":"string"}],"type":"array"},"positive":{"type":"boolean"},"predicate":{"enum":[